{"unit_id": "DDDMUC__dsh-session-url#feature-1", "repo": "DDDMUC/dsh-session-url", "commit": "07ef7da47d3eeaaeaadb508fc300b3721d144b67", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-session-url 的功能「双向同步」：主视图当前会话会写入 URL 片段，打开会话片段链接也会导航到对应会话；只替换地址，不新增历史记录。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/client.js:87-90", "lib/client.js:161-194"]}
