{"unit_id": "DDDMUC__dsh-session-url#feature-3", "repo": "DDDMUC/dsh-session-url", "commit": "07ef7da47d3eeaaeaadb508fc300b3721d144b67", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-session-url 的功能「侧边栏会话链接」：为匹配的侧边栏会话行添加覆盖整行的真实锚点，支持浏览器原生复制链接或新标签操作，普通点击仍调用当前页导航。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/client.js:340-387", "lib/client.js:396-413"]}
