{"unit_id": "DDDMUC__dsh-session-url#caveat-1", "repo": "DDDMUC/dsh-session-url", "commit": "07ef7da47d3eeaaeaadb508fc300b3721d144b67", "type": "caveat", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-session-url 使用 8 秒链接优先窗口；页面启动时若用户立即点选其他会话，链接目标可能再被打开一次，超时后才由当前视图接管地址栏。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/client.js:103-123", "lib/client.js:174-191"]}
{"unit_id": "DDDMUC__dsh-session-url#caveat-2", "repo": "DDDMUC/dsh-session-url", "commit": "07ef7da47d3eeaaeaadb508fc300b3721d144b67", "type": "caveat", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-session-url 的侧栏整行链接依赖官方会话行的 data-row-key 属性；官方界面结构变更时整行链接可能消失，但地址栏同步仍独立运行。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/client.js:302-312", "lib/client.js:422-455"]}
